  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Mongolia 2024 (DRRS24MN04)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Technical Assistance (TA) programme envisions to support the Municipality of Ulaanbaatar (MoUB) in two broad areas related to flood resilience:1.	To improve the technical capacity of MoUB officers to plan and design Ulaanbaatar&apos;s water system infrastructure better, and support officers in conducting maintenance works to the existing river and drainage system through technical trainings, and2.	To identify the most pressing issues (no-regret interventions) that prevent Ulaanbaatar&apos;s river system to become flood-proof during the next flood season.</narrative>
  </description>
